# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
#
# Now that this app is being published on the Play Store, the release key
# must never be committed - CI reconstructs key.properties and the .jks
# from repository secrets at build time instead (see build-apk.yml). A
# previous key was briefly committed here under the old assumption that
# there was no Play Store presence yet; it's been rotated out and this
# negation removed.
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
